{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a fully customizable Shopify section called “Four Image Gallery.”
    
    The section should display 4 images side by side on desktop, with a clean, modern, minimal aesthetic.
    On mobile, it should automatically adapt into a 2×2 square layout (two on top, two on bottom).
    Each image must always remain fully visible (no cropping or hidden edges), and all layout, spacing, and animation options must be adjustable in the Shopify theme editor — no coding required.
    
    🖼️ Individual Image Settings
    
    Each of the 4 images must be individually editable with the following options in the theme editor:
    
    Upload image
    
    Image width and height: adjustable (default 200px × 200px) with locked aspect ratio
    
    Left and right margins: adjustable from –200px to 200px
    
    Top and bottom margins: adjustable from –200px to 200px
    
    Padding: adjustable 0–100px
    
    Gap (distance to the next image): adjustable from –100px to 100px (allows closer or overlapping positioning)
    
    Corner radius: adjustable 0–50px
    
    Optional clickable link for each image
    
    🧩 Section-Wide Controls
    
    Global top and bottom padding: adjustable 0–200px
    
    Global left and right margins: adjustable –200px to 200px
    
    Global gap between all images: adjustable –100px to 100px
    
    Optional background color selector
    
    Optional section heading and subheading above the images
    
    🖥️ Desktop Layout
    
    Display all 4 images in one horizontal row (flex or grid layout).
    
    Maintain even scaling and spacing between images.
    
    Hover effect (see below) triggers individually for each image.
    
    All images remain visible inside their frame — no cropping or overset ever.
    
    🪄 Hover Animation (Desktop)
    
    On hover, the image zooms slightly for a subtle focus effect but remains fully visible:
    
    transform: scale(1.05) translateZ(0);
    object-fit: contain;
    overflow: visible;
    transition: transform 0.4s ease-in-out;
    
    
    The effect must never cut edges or hide parts of the image.
    
    Smooth, elegant transition — works well with minimalist layouts., 📱 Mobile Layout and Animation
    
    On mobile (max-width: 768px), the layout automatically becomes a 2×2 square grid.
    
    Each image remains fully visible and can be individually positioned:
    
    Mobile top/bottom margin: adjustable –200px to 200px
    
    Mobile left/right margin: adjustable –200px to 200px
    
    Padding: adjustable (same range as desktop)
    
    All distances, gaps, and margins remain fully flexible and editable in the theme editor.
    
    🎞️ Mobile Animation (Sequential Zoom)
    
    Since mobile doesn’t support hover, add an automatic looping animation that zooms each image one by one:
    
    Order: top-left → top-right → bottom-left → bottom-right
    
    Each image zooms in smoothly (scale(1.05)) and returns to normal (scale(1)), lasting about 0.8–1 second each.
    
    Delay between each image: 0.3–0.5 seconds
    
    After all four have animated, wait ~3 seconds before restarting the cycle.
    
    The animation must be subtle and elegant — a “living gallery” effect that feels calm and premium.
    
    The images should never overlap or move outside their visible area.
    
    Example animation logic:
    
    @keyframes slowZoom {
      0%, 100% { transform: scale(1); }
      50% { transform: scale(1.05); }
    }
    
    /* Apply delays for sequence */
    .image-block:nth-child(1) img { animation: slowZoom 6s ease-in-out infinite; animation-delay: 0s; }
    .image-block:nth-child(2) img { animation: slowZoom 6s ease-in-out infinite; animation-delay: 1s; }
    .image-block:nth-child(3) img { animation: slowZoom 6s ease-in-out infinite; animation-delay: 2s; }
    .image-block:nth-child(4) img { animation: slowZoom 6s ease-in-out infinite; animation-delay: 3s; }
    
    
    Adjust durations so the full loop feels smooth (~9–10 seconds total).
    
    The animation pauses naturally when the user interacts with the page (scrolls or taps).
    
    ⚙️ Technical & Design Requirements
    
    Default image container size: 200×200px, adjustable
    
    All elements use CSS grid or flexbox for stability
    
    No cropping: always show full image inside its frame
    
    Enable lazy loading for faster page performance
    
    Include alt
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-four-image-gallery-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    padding-top: {{ block.settings.section_padding_top }}px;
    padding-bottom: {{ block.settings.section_padding_bottom }}px;
    margin-left: {{ block.settings.section_margin_left }}px;
    margin-right: {{ block.settings.section_margin_right }}px;
    {% if block.settings.background_color != blank %}
      background-color: {{ block.settings.background_color }};
    {% endif %}
  }

  .ai-four-image-gallery__container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: 100%;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .ai-four-image-gallery__header-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }

  .ai-four-image-gallery__heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    margin: 0 0 12px;
    font-size: 32px;
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
  }

  .ai-four-image-gallery__subheading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 16px;
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    opacity: 0.8;
  }

  .ai-four-image-gallery__grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: {{ block.settings.global_gap }}px;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .ai-four-image-gallery__item-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    overflow: visible;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .ai-four-image-gallery__item-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    position: relative;
    overflow: visible;
  }

  .ai-four-image-gallery__image-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    overflow: visible;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .ai-four-image-gallery__image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: contain;
    transition: transform 0.4s ease-in-out;
    will-change: transform;
  }

  .ai-four-image-gallery__placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: #f4f4f4;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
  }

  .ai-four-image-gallery__placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: contain;
  }

  @media (min-width: 769px) {
    .ai-four-image-gallery__grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      flex-wrap: nowrap;
    }

    .ai-four-image-gallery__item-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover .ai-four-image-gallery__image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      transform: scale(1.05) translateZ(0);
    }

    .ai-four-image-gallery__item-1-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      width: {{ block.settings.image_1_width }}px;
      height: {{ block.settings.image_1_height }}px;
      margin-left: {{ block.settings.image_1_margin_left }}px;
      margin-right: {{ block.settings.image_1_margin_right }}px;
      margin-top: {{ block.settings.image_1_margin_top }}px;
      margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.image_1_margin_bottom }}px;
      padding: {{ block.settings.image_1_padding }}px;
    }

    .ai-four-image-gallery__item-1-{{ ai_gen_id }} .ai-four-image-gallery__image-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      border-radius: {{ block.settings.image_1_radius }}px;
    }

    .ai-four-image-gallery__item-2-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      width: {{ block.settings.image_2_width }}px;
      height: {{ block.settings.image_2_height }}px;
      margin-left: {{ block.settings.image_2_margin_left }}px;
      margin-right: {{ block.settings.image_2_margin_right }}px;
      margin-top: {{ block.settings.image_2_margin_top }}px;
      margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.image_2_margin_bottom }}px;
      padding: {{ block.settings.image_2_padding }}px;
    }

    .ai-four-image-gallery__item-2-{{ ai_gen_id }} .ai-four-image-gallery__image-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      border-radius: {{ block.settings.image_2_radius }}px;
    }

    .ai-four-image-gallery__item-3-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      width: {{ block.settings.image_3_width }}px;
      height: {{ block.settings.image_3_height }}px;
      margin-left: {{ block.settings.image_3_margin_left }}px;
      margin-right: {{ block.settings.image_3_margin_right }}px;
      margin-top: {{ block.settings.image_3_margin_top }}px;
      margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.image_3_margin_bottom }}px;
      padding: {{ block.settings.image_3_padding }}px;
    }

    .ai-four-image-gallery__item-3-{{ ai_gen_id }} .ai-four-image-gallery__image-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      border-radius: {{ block.settings.image_3_radius }}px;
    }

    .ai-four-image-gallery__item-4-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      width: {{ block.settings.image_4_width }}px;
      height: {{ block.settings.image_4_height }}px;
      margin-left: {{ block.settings.image_4_margin_left }}px;
      margin-right: {{ block.settings.image_4_margin_right }}px;
      margin-top: {{ block.settings.image_4_margin_top }}px;
      margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.image_4_margin_bottom }}px;
      padding: {{ block.settings.image_4_padding }}px;
    }

    .ai-four-image-gallery__item-4-{{ ai_gen_id }} .ai-four-image-gallery__image-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      border-radius: {{ block.settings.image_4_radius }}px;
    }
  }

  @keyframes ai-four-image-gallery-zoom-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    0%, 100% {
      transform: scale(1) translateZ(0);
    }
    50% {
      transform: scale(1.05) translateZ(0);
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .ai-four-image-gallery__grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: {{ block.settings.mobile_gap }}px;
    }

    .ai-four-image-gallery__item-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      width: 100%;
      aspect-ratio: 1;
    }

    .ai-four-image-gallery__item-1-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      margin-left: {{ block.settings.mobile_image_1_margin_left }}px;
      margin-right: {{ block.settings.mobile_image_1_margin_right }}px;
      margin-top: {{ block.settings.mobile_image_1_margin_top }}px;
      margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.mobile_image_1_margin_bottom }}px;
      padding: {{ block.settings.mobile_image_1_padding }}px;
    }

    .ai-four-image-gallery__item-1-{{ ai_gen_id }} .ai-four-image-gallery__image-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      border-radius: {{ block.settings.image_1_radius }}px;
    }

    .ai-four-image-gallery__item-2-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      margin-left: {{ block.settings.mobile_image_2_margin_left }}px;
      margin-right: {{ block.settings.mobile_image_2_margin_right }}px;
      margin-top: {{ block.settings.mobile_image_2_margin_top }}px;
      margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.mobile_image_2_margin_bottom }}px;
      padding: {{ block.settings.mobile_image_2_padding }}px;
    }

    .ai-four-image-gallery__item-2-{{ ai_gen_id }} .ai-four-image-gallery__image-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      border-radius: {{ block.settings.image_2_radius }}px;
    }

    .ai-four-image-gallery__item-3-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      margin-left: {{ block.settings.mobile_image_3_margin_left }}px;
      margin-right: {{ block.settings.mobile_image_3_margin_right }}px;
      margin-top: {{ block.settings.mobile_image_3_margin_top }}px;
      margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.mobile_image_3_margin_bottom }}px;
      padding: {{ block.settings.mobile_image_3_padding }}px;
    }

    .ai-four-image-gallery__item-3-{{ ai_gen_id }} .ai-four-image-gallery__image-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      border-radius: {{ block.settings.image_3_radius }}px;
    }

    .ai-four-image-gallery__item-4-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      margin-left: {{ block.settings.mobile_image_4_margin_left }}px;
      margin-right: {{ block.settings.mobile_image_4_margin_right }}px;
      margin-top: {{ block.settings.mobile_image_4_margin_top }}px;
      margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.mobile_image_4_margin_bottom }}px;
      padding: {{ block.settings.mobile_image_4_padding }}px;
    }

    .ai-four-image-gallery__item-4-{{ ai_gen_id }} .ai-four-image-gallery__image-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      border-radius: {{ block.settings.image_4_radius }}px;
    }

    {% if block.settings.enable_mobile_animation %}
      .ai-four-image-gallery__item-1-{{ ai_gen_id }} .ai-four-image-gallery__image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
        animation: ai-four-image-gallery-zoom-{{ ai_gen_id }} 10s ease-in-out infinite;
        animation-delay: 0s;
      }

      .ai-four-image-gallery__item-2-{{ ai_gen_id }} .ai-four-image-gallery__image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
        animation: ai-four-image-gallery-zoom-{{ ai_gen_id }} 10s ease-in-out infinite;
        animation-delay: 1s;
      }

      .ai-four-image-gallery__item-3-{{ ai_gen_id }} .ai-four-image-gallery__image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
        animation: ai-four-image-gallery-zoom-{{ ai_gen_id }} 10s ease-in-out infinite;
        animation-delay: 2s;
      }

      .ai-four-image-gallery__item-4-{{ ai_gen_id }} .ai-four-image-gallery__image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
        animation: ai-four-image-gallery-zoom-{{ ai_gen_id }} 10s ease-in-out infinite;
        animation-delay: 3s;
      }
    {% endif %}
  }
{% endstyle %}

<div class="ai-four-image-gallery-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-four-image-gallery__container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    {% if block.settings.heading != blank or block.settings.subheading != blank %}
      <div class="ai-four-image-gallery__header-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {% if block.settings.heading != blank %}
          <h2 class="ai-four-image-gallery__heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.heading }}</h2>
        {% endif %}
        {% if block.settings.subheading != blank %}
          <p class="ai-four-image-gallery__subheading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.subheading }}</p>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
    {% endif %}

    <div class="ai-four-image-gallery__grid-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      {% for i in (1..4) %}
        {% liquid
          assign image_key = 'image_' | append: i
          assign link_key = 'image_' | append: i | append: '_link'
          assign image = block.settings[image_key]
          assign link = block.settings[link_key]
        %}

        <div class="ai-four-image-gallery__item-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-four-image-gallery__item-{{ i }}-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {% if link != blank %}
            <a href="{{ link }}" class="ai-four-image-gallery__item-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {% else %}
            <div class="ai-four-image-gallery__item-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {% endif %}
            <div class="ai-four-image-gallery__image-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {% if image %}
                <img
                  src="{{ image | image_url: width: 800 }}"
                  alt="{{ image.alt | escape }}"
                  loading="lazy"
                  width="{{ image.width }}"
                  height="{{ image.height }}"
                  class="ai-four-image-gallery__image-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                >
              {% else %}
                <div class="ai-four-image-gallery__placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  {{ 'image' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
                </div>
              {% endif %}
            </div>
          {% if link != blank %}
            </a>
          {% else %}
            </div>
          {% endif %}
        </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

